<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arterial Vascular.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arterial Vascular.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it added Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said had Arterial Vascular as market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Arterial Vascular was up 2-3/4 to 29-5/8.</p>
